{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_sunbr_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_sunbr_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"成長","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sunbr_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"095c98ed03a76d2b0656f6563d37919fc5ee09f6bd3b349d81bd7571c16cdd91","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有很多回憶。\n好的，壞的。\n快樂的，悲傷的。\n還有不管怎麼樣都忘不掉的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她們在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點過來，她們逃不了了......她們有食物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"拉達，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，一群臭蟲！安娜，拉達，到我身後來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，你們膽子不小，來啊，我看誰敢上前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅莎琳","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛啊，怎麼又來了，我胳膊還沒好全呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅莎琳","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，索尼婭，我們要不要比比看，誰能解決掉更多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"少說廢話......小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，在這種時候走神可不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位將軍，要專心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，羅莎琳，小心身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"謝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅莎琳","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"敢偷襲我，看來你們是做好準備了吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要慌，別被她們嚇到，她們只有這麼點人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對，她們只有這麼點人！別給她們機會喊救援，我們一起上，一定沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼辦？對面說得對，我們人數不佔優勢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（......只能想辦法衝出去了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起啊，但是......我們也沒有辦法，我們必須要拿到食物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想挨餓......我不想在這種地方餓死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別給她們逃走的機會，把門堵住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳，這群混帳，沒完沒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅莎琳","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"你該不會撐不住了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅莎琳","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"呸。哎，我好像掉了一顆牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，他們人數不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，小心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索尼婭","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把食物交出來！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（倒地抽搐）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安娜","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"拉達......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉達","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉達","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不許對索尼婭姐動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉達","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她瘋了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男學生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她把安德列的脖子砸斷了！小心，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉達","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"拉達......拉達要保護大家......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉達","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不許你們傷害姐姐們！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有很多回憶。\n好的，壞的。\n快樂的，悲傷的。\n還有不管怎麼樣都不願意再想起的。\n古米傷害了別人。\n到底是為了保護姐姐們，還是為了自己不受傷呢？\n古米分不清。\n但古米......古米已經不想再傷害任何人了。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼在這種地方睡著了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"醒一醒，古米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"醒一醒，古米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼臉色這麼差，傷口還痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好像做了個噩夢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口已經一點都不痛了，真理姐別擔心，古米沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？真理姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不說話，是要出發了嗎？古米隨時都可以走，凜冬姐和烈夏姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，還沒到出發時間，還可以再休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人出去探路，應該過一會就回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那古米也去幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，古米，你別亂動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你的傷沒有你說的那麼輕巧吧。別亂動，我給你重新上一次藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"其實真的沒有很嚴重啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！古米保證！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，只是稍微有一點點痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的真理姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......好多傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的傷，疤痕已經有點淡了。今天這一道傷口不知道會不會留下印記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"希望不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部的姐姐們會給古米超級好用的藥膏，每天塗一塗，一定能把不好看的傷疤都消除掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，身上的傷這一年多來都治得差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，剛剛我們被那群賞金獵人襲擊的時候，其實你是可以不受傷的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼沒有繼續追擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一擊的時候，你的手頓住了，你在猶豫......這很危險，古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是古米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米沒有辦法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......古米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"其實堅雷教官也和我提過你的習慣問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你在害怕，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米很害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"第三下，古米控制不住自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米會想起、想起在學校的時候，晚上會做噩夢，就算開著小夜燈也沒有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我......知道，你睡不著，就會不斷翻身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，凜冬也知道，這件事只能靠你自己克服，所以我們不會多說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"但是古米，我們都很擔心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米在努力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你很努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我們之中最堅強的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米現在已經不需要小夜燈，也可以睡著了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有的時候還是會跑來找我和凜冬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米要努力長大，努力把不好的習慣都改掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米問了阿米婭和凱爾希醫生，醫生說，古米的爸爸媽媽在做很危險的工作，想要見到爸爸媽媽會很難很難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你想去找他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"想。但是現在還不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米不希望爸爸媽媽看到古米現在的樣子。見面的時候，不希望爸爸媽媽覺得古米是個壞孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在還不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是壞孩子，古米。你是在保護我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是、但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米還是做不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米控制不住自己，會傷害到別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真理姐，古米到底該怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......會有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算一時改不過來，也沒有關係。我們都在你身邊，古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都陪著你，別害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......真理姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！有姐姐們在，古米什麼都不怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，勇敢的小熊，別再讓自己受傷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀痛，別戳別戳，痛啊真理姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在知道痛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"藥塗好了，凜冬她們差不多也該回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們休息好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐，古米已經沒事了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口已經處理好了，應該不影響行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那邊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的村子不太對勁，太安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"可能還是那些賞金獵人在搞鬼，一會大家都小心點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"明明只是尋找走丟孩子的任務而已，哎呀，真是出乎意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼就惹上那些賞金獵人了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？是對方先挑釁的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"那群混帳還綁了兩個孩子！我們要找的不就是孩子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，既然碰上了，就沒有現在回頭不管的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"之前被他們逃了，這次可不會這麼簡單......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"要小心些，那些人不好對付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"他們手上有孩子在，不能太過刺激他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果壞人再出現，就由古米來保護姐姐們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，古米會把壞人都打趴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，萬一他們不出現呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......揪出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真麻煩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個想法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"請問有人嗎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好像沒有人在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看來這次是調查不到什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，我們回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這可沒辦法交差啊，看來只能下次拜託其他幹員再來一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......下次應該就是經驗豐富的前輩們來了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，那什麼......哦對，有個超級強也當賞金獵人的前輩，據說能徒手拆、拆大樓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（羅莎琳，演得太差了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"（我不擅長這種的啊！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"走啦走啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"前輩們一定能把壞人都抓出來的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（有聲音，來了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"呼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"擋下來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"少多管閒事，小傢伙們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我還從來沒後悔過，有本事就試試啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"和他們廢什麼話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我問你們，這裡就你們幾個人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們把這個村子的人怎麼了，之前被你們綁走的兩個孩子現在在哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（......完全不說話耶。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"看來只能強行讓他們說話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！要動手了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然說得好像很輕鬆......但是大家應該知道這和之前的模擬訓練不一樣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米會保護大家的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好重......！不過，古米可以撐住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（停頓）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，給我閃開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，還差一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"差一點我就能打倒這傢伙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不可以東張西望哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真理姐！站到古米身後來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"休想......突破古米這一關！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，古米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓他們慢下來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，趁現在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"小菜一碟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"說大話可不好，明明氣喘吁吁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷了！是、是剛剛替古米擋的那一下？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"都是古米不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"煩，少哭哭啼啼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，就是，一看就是她自己大意了，不是古米你的問題啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，現在還有其他事情要解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，怎麼樣，現在就剩下你一個人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"快說，這個村子怎麼回事，還有你們抓走的兩個孩子在哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不說的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不說的話，就、就把你的牙齒和頭髮都拔掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（......那倒也不必。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，幾個小崽子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘴巴放乾淨點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你們打得過幾個人又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的目的是找那幾個小孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"趕快老實交代！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，天真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了，這裡知道那些小孩下落的只有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我不開口，你們就不可能找到他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"拒不開口對你也沒什麼好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，這種時候，一般都是要開始談條件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先放了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩個小孩我們會送回村子，至於其他的，你們不要多管閒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你要說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思——我拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是你挨打，憑什麼和我們談條件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（他也沉默了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（不會真的咬死不說吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（有點難辦，總不至於真的要逼供......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"再抽他兩巴掌不就結了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，說得太大聲了啦，凜冬姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"居然敢小看我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——該死的熊崽子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——？！呃啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你卑鄙......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"手段只要有用就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"去死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，你這小鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不許傷害索尼婭姐......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"還差一下......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，古米！我沒事，別衝動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還要問出孩子們的下落！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米......還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"好慘，他死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，他還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的羅莎琳，可以麻煩你幫我把這位先生抬到那邊去嗎？我要幫他止血，順便讓他“清醒”過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題是沒問題......但你幹嘛突然這樣喊我，怪嚇人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，過來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐，傷口......在流血，我、我幫你包紮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，凜冬姐，真理姐。古米......又闖禍了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別說傻話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你闖什麼禍了？你是救了我，我謝你還來不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有可是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，你在害怕，但還是保護了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"況且......古米，我清楚你的力氣有多大。如果你真的全力打中對方的腦袋，他現在早就該沒氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那他——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，人沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能再敲他一次，直接把他敲醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米、古米控制住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你控制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的那一下，你明明已經揮出去了，但是又收住了力道，我看得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"還有凜冬，也過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不叫上我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"這是要玩什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"吵死了，你別擠我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滿地狼藉中，烏薩斯學生自治團的孩子們親密地聚在一起。\n真理牽起古米的左手，凜冬拉起右邊那隻。小熊們手拉著手，頭挨著頭，即使被他人的鬢髮掃得面頰發癢，也沒有人退開。\n古米將腦袋擠在同伴中間，用額頭輕輕碰碰同伴的前額，就像是她們一直以來玩耍時做的那樣。\n然後她獲得了一個親密的回撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，還記得我之前說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經做得很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，我們都陪著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯沒錯，小古米做得真不錯！最後那一下擋得漂亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，已經快要比還控制不住自己脾氣的某人要強了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啥？你說誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐別跳起來，小心傷口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米、古米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米真的......做到了？真的沒、沒用全力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。你做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一會就能把對方叫醒，然後問出那些孩子的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我會讓他說出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，你不僅保護了我們，還救了那幾個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米......控制住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......古米做到了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"要帶上這個，還有這個......嗯，多帶點小麵包！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，背包終於收拾好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽，拉達馬上要準備去找你們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然凱爾希醫生說會很難，但我還是想去試一試！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，拉達現在每次打人的時候已經不會再有停頓......也不會完全控制不住第三下的力氣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不會再讓姐姐們擔心......也不會讓爸爸媽媽擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了姐姐們，雖然還是會做噩夢，但是現在拉達已經不會那麼害怕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽，拉達在這裡過得很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，拉達還得去和姐姐們打聲招呼，這還是拉達頭一次自己出遠門，但是我一定還會回來，姐姐們一定要等著拉達......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好，就錄到這裡好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"——出發啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_115_headbr","aliases":["凜冬","索尼婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_194_rosali","aliases":["烈夏","羅莎琳"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["安娜","真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["古米","拉達"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["娜塔莉婭","早露"]}]}
